
======================================================================================================================
CFG119 -- Door 7: FDM soliton plus baryons (Schrodinger-Poisson ground state) against the CFG44 target
======================================================================================================================
  Frozen criteria: ../CFG119_FROZEN_CRITERIA.md.  Shared gates: ../closure_map/TEN_DOORS_GATES_2026-09-29.md.
  Target: CFG44 Bcommon (read-only): C(r) = rho_c r^3 g_tot = (a0/4 pi) M_b(<r).  Pass band for C_SP/C_target: [0.9, 1.1]
  over x = r/r_M in [0.1, 30] (601 log-spaced points), M_b = 1e9..1e12 Msun, point mass and exponential spheres
  (h = 2, 3, 4, 5 kpc), ONE m at every mass.  m grid (frozen, not tuned): 1e-23, 1e-22, 1e-21, 1e-20 eV.
  a0: canonical 9.36030e-11 m/s^2 (Bcommon), alt 1.13120e-10 m/s^2 (FP0).
  Method: finite-difference (t = ln r, step 1e-3) inverse iteration for the lowest eigenpair inside a self-consistent
  (Anderson-mixed) iteration on Phi_psi, started from the rescaled no-baryon soliton; eps converged to < 1e-11 between
  iterations; tails in log space (no underflow).  Cross-checks: shooting (C1x), Newton on the coupled system (N2),
  half the grid step (N3).  Departures from the frozen file are listed in the README.
    m = 1e-23 eV: hbar/m = 191.715 kpc km/s
    m = 1e-22 eV: hbar/m = 19.1715 kpc km/s
    m = 1e-21 eV: hbar/m = 1.91715 kpc km/s
    m = 1e-20 eV: hbar/m = 0.191715 kpc km/s

